## Skills reference

| Skill | What it does |
|---|---|
| `/create-brief` | MCP / interview / paste → `brief.md` (never hand-fill the template) |
| `/build-deck` | End-to-end: brief → PPTX (delegates deck-builder) |
| `/build-doc` | Brief or deck → branded DOCX |
| `/create-outline` | Brief → structured outline for review |
| `/write-slide` | Write content for one slide |
| `/revise-deck` | Surgical edits + HTML preview |
| `/preview-deck` | HTML preview before PPTX export |
| `/polish-deck` | Retrofit depth onto an existing deck: notes, takeaways, chart highlights |
| `/brand-check` | Review content for brand compliance |
| `/export-pptx` | Convert deck JSON → PPTX (fast tweak path) |
| `/export-docx` | Convert doc JSON → DOCX |
| `/export-metrics-xlsx` | Metrics/chart slides → branded XLSX |

